                        connection</text><text x="380" y="110" text-anchor="middle" font-size="11" fill="#6b7280">locked
                        with your token</text>
                    <rect x="550" y="60" width="190" height="70" rx="10" fill="#000" /><text x="645" y="90"
                        text-anchor="middle" font-size="13" font-weight="600" fill="#fff">Your Library</text><text
                        x="645" y="110" text-anchor="middle" font-size="11" fill="#d1d5db">only yours</text>
                    <path d="M210 82 H288" stroke="#111" stroke-width="1.5" marker-end="url(#a5)" />
